<title>USA: Exar names Donald Ciffone president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Exar names Donald Ciffone president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>EXAR Corp said Monday that Donald Ciffone has been elected as the new president and chief executive, effective immediately.</p>
<p>Ciffone has also been appointed to the board.</p>
<p>He succeeds George Wells, who had previously announced his intention to step down as CEO and president but will continue on the board.</p>
<p>Ciffone has experience in the semiconductor industry and served most recently as executive vice president of Toshiba America the U.S. semiconductor subsidiary of Toshiba Corp.</p>
</text>
